{"title":"Career Roadmap · VFX Artist","role":"VFX Artist","summary":"A VFX Artist creates or integrates digital visual effects for films, OTT content, television, advertising, games, and immersive media. The work can involve compositing, 3D modelling, texturing, lighting, simulation, matchmoving, rotoscoping, matte painting, CGI, environments, and digital effects.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Des (Bachelor of Design)","Course":"Animation & Game Design"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Approx. Timeline","Target"],"rows":[[{"text":"Foundation"},{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Drawing, design, 3D and visual fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Technical Foundation"},{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Modelling, texturing, lighting, compositing"}],[{"text":"Specialisation"},{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Advanced VFX pipeline + production projects"}],[{"text":"Industry Preparation"},{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Internship + professional showreel"}],[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Junior VFX Artist"}],[{"text":"Growth"},{"text":"3–6 years"},{"text":"VFX Artist / Specialist"}],[{"text":"Mid Career"},{"text":"6–10 years"},{"text":"Senior Artist / Lead"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"10–15 years"},{"text":"VFX Supervisor / CG Supervisor"}],[{"text":"Long-term"},{"text":"15+ years"},{"text":"VFX Director / Creative Director"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Visual & 3D Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong fundamentals in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Art"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Drawing"},{"text":"Perspective"},{"text":"Composition"},{"text":"Colour theory"},{"text":"Light and shadow"},{"text":"Form"},{"text":"Anatomy"},{"text":"Visual storytelling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3D fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"3D space"},{"text":"Modelling"},{"text":"Materials"},